> [Much][ of][ our][ work][ involves][ guiding][ public][ policies][ to][ ensure][ Hawaii][ residents][ have][ choices][ about][ the][ kind][ of][ community][ they][ want][ to][ live][ in][ and][ the][ type][ of][ home][ they][ can][ afford][.][
][In][ 2012][,][ we][ launched][ I][ M][ua][ Rail][,][ a][ multi][-][media][ campaign][ designed][ to][ engage][ supporters][ of][ Honolulu][�][�][s][ Rail][ Transit][ project][.][ By][ understanding][ deeply][ ingrained][ values][ and][ concerns][ surrounding][ rail][ transit][,][ we][ continue][ to][ help][ the][ community][ envision][ the][ future][ of][ O][ahu][ in][ a][ way][ that][ is][ tangible][ and][ meaningful][.]

